Soft, cinematic blue hour lighting contrasts with the warm amber glow emanating from a paper lantern hanging on the corridor. A young woman with porcelain skin, dressed in a luxurious white and red Hanfu with intricate embroidery, stands by the red wooden railing, gazing out at the falling snowflakes. Her black hair is styled in an elegant traditional bun adorned with a jade hairpin. (Sound FX: Howling wind, crunching snow, distant wind chimes)\nShot 2: [Close-up, Shallow Depth of Field]\nThe camera focuses on her delicate face, illuminated by the soft lantern light. Visible breath vapor escapes her lips in the cold air. She reaches out a hand to catch a falling snowflake, her eyes reflecting a mix of anticipation and serenity. She turns slightly towards the camera (or an unseen companion) and speaks softly. (Dialogue: \"这雪越下越大了，也不知那壶酒温好了没。\")\nShot 3: [Medium Shot, Dolly Back]\nShe gently brushes the melting snow from her hand and turns back towards the warm interior of the room. The camera pulls back slowly, framing her silhouette against the glowing lattice window, while the snow continues to fall heavily in the foreground, creating a beautiful bokeh effect. (Sound FX: Door creaking open, crackling charcoal fire sound)"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":199,"type":"ImpactInt","pos":[1000,2050],"size":[210,60],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"值","localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"整数","localized_name":"整数","name":"INT","type":"INT","links":[447,448]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ImpactInt","cnr_id":"comfyui-impact-pack","ver":"6a517ebe06fea2b74fc41b3bd089c0d7173eeced"},"widgets_values":[201],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":128,"type":"LTXVAudioVAEDecode","pos":[6000,1790],"size":[270,50],"flags":{},"order":41,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"samples","localized_name":"样本","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":297},{"label":"audio_vae","localized_name":"音频V